WEBVTT

00:08:27.958 --> 00:08:30.750
(Applause)

00:08:39.500 --> 00:08:42.582
And when we start using this ice method,

00:08:44.458 --> 00:08:48.500
well, the possibilities become
much bigger than us.

00:08:49.542 --> 00:08:52.833
In fact, they become smaller than you.

00:08:54.583 --> 00:08:56.934
On a molecular level,

00:08:56.958 --> 00:08:59.976
I believe that that insight

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:01.809
is the unifying theme